IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `apa-passports`

-- Australian Passports Act 2005 (Cth), ss 6(1), 7, 8, 11, 12, 14-17, 20, 48 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_australian-passports-act-2005.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

-- Applications. Jake's 2016 passport date (2021-06-15) and Anjali's application date (2027-07-01) are ASSUMED.
