    `application date` IS 20110601
    `age at application` IS 8
    `has ever been married` IS FALSE
    `is an Australian citizen` IS TRUE
    `the Minister is satisfied the person is a citizen` IS TRUE
    `the Minister is satisfied of the person's identity` IS TRUE
    `made in the approved form with the applicable fee` IS TRUE
    `persons with parental responsibility` IS 2
    `of them, persons who consent` IS 2
    `a court order permits the document, international travel, or living or spending time with someone outside Australia` IS FALSE
    `special circumstances in a Minister's determination exist` IS FALSE
    `the Minister is satisfied the child's welfare would be adversely affected without travel` IS FALSE
    `the Minister is satisfied the child urgently needs to travel because of a family crisis` IS FALSE
    `no non-consenting person can be contacted within a reasonable period` IS FALSE
    `is outside Australia` IS FALSE
    `has departed Australia` IS FALSE
    `months from departing Australia to the application` IS 0
    `the Minister considers a document should issue to enable return` IS FALSE
    `a refusal/cancellation request under s 12(1) or (1A)` IS FALSE
    `already holds an Australian travel document` IS FALSE
    `date specified on that document` IS 0
    `that document has ceased under a determination or been cancelled` IS FALSE
    `that document is suspended` IS FALSE
    `a Minister's determination permits a further document` IS FALSE
    `a refusal/cancellation request under s 14(1) or 16(1)` IS FALSE
    `documents lost or stolen in the 5 years before the application` IS 0
    `the Minister exercises a discretion to refuse` IS FALSE

